00010 *
00020 * RPG III in the System/38 environment. The specifications are
00030 * the same; the /COPY member is named filename.library,member
00040 * instead of library/filename,member.
00050 *
00060 * Member: RPG38   Compilable: complete program, but not built;
00070 *         its files and /COPY member are not defined here
00080 * Source: RPG/400 Reference SC09-1817, chapter 1 (/COPY) and the
00090 *         System/38 environment notes in chapters 4 and 5.
00100 * Retrieved: 2026-07-26
00110 *
00120 /TITLE System/38 environment sample
00130 /COPY QRPGSRC.PAYLIB,PAYFLDS
00140H        1   M D                                                     PAY38
00150F*
00160F* Files.
00170FPAYMAST IP  F     128  6AI     1 DISK
00180FPAYRPT  O   F     132     OV     PRINTER
00190E*
00200E* A compile-time table.
00210E                    TAXCDE  1   5  3  A            Tax codes
00220I*
00230I* Input.
00240IPAYMAST AA1 01   1 CP
00250I                                        1   6 EMPNBRL1
00260I                                        7  26 EMPNAM
00270I                                    P  27  312GROSS       20  22
00280C*
00290C* Calculations.
00300C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     NET     92
00310C           EMPNBR    LOKUPTAXCDE               30  31
00320C           *IN31     IFEQ *ON
00330C           GROSS     MULT TAXRAT    TAX     92
00340C           TAX       SUB  GROSS     NET
00350C                     ELSE
00360C                     Z-ADDGROSS     NET
00370C                     ENDIF
00380CLR                   SETON                         LRLast record
00390O*
00400O* Output.
00410OPAYRPT  H   01  1P
00420O                                   40 'PAYROLL REGISTER'
00430OPAYRPT  D  1     01
00440O                         EMPNBR     6
00450O                         EMPNAM    30
00460O                         NET   J   45
00470OPAYRPT  T 1      LR
00480O                                   40 'END OF REPORT'
**    Tax codes, one entry per record
